<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Oct 30.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Oct 30.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Mangalore port as at October 30,1996:</p>
<p>  Commodity	     Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Wood Pulp	 1,640 (ULD)    478	Med Bia Region  28/10</p>
<p> Granite	   1,500 (LDD)    900	Haulien Express 27/10</p>
<p> Urea		1,237 (ULD)  4,525	Jay Laxmi	 10/10</p>
<p> Benzene	   2,000 (ULD)    ---	Lodestar Prince 30/10</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
